  "title": "Lucas Numbers Modulo m",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Conjecture The sequence {L(n) mod m}, where L(n) are the Lucas numbers, contains a complete residue system modulo m if and only if m is one of the following: 2, 4, 6, 7, 14, 3^k, k >=1.",
